  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">F&#xf6;rberedande fas: Gr&#xe4;ns&#xf6;verskridande dialog f&#xf6;r   fred i Stora sj&#xf6;regionen</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Preparatory phase: Trans-border Dialogue for      Peace in the Great Lakes Region - Interpeace Regional</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A preparatory phase of a three-year program aimed at creating a       peacebuilding dialogue between people of Rwanda, Burundi and Eastern  DR Congo. The initial phase will provide the implementing partner     organisations time to further develop the program proposal, identify  partners in eastern DR Congo, select the topic that the research      shall focus on and to elaborate the results framework.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">En f&#xf6;rberedande fas av ett tre&#xe5;rigt program med syfte att skapa en    fredsbyggande dialog mellan inv&#xe5;nare i Rwanda, Burundi och &#xf6;stra DR   Kongo.  Den inledande fasen ska ge de genomf&#xf6;rande                    samarbetsorganisationerna tid att vidareutveckla sitt programf&#xf6;rslag, identifiera partners i &#xf6;stra DR Kongo, v&#xe4;lja det &#xe4;mnesomr&#xe5;de som      forskningen ska fokusera p&#xe5; samt arbeta vidare med resultatramverket.</narrative>
  </description>
